  crumb: 'Clean & seal',
  eyebrow: 'Clean & seal · Palm Beach County',
  h1: 'Paver cleaning and sealing',
  h1em: 'in Palm Beach County.',
  lede: 'Refresh your existing driveway, patio or pool deck with the service it needs: cleaning only, cleaning with joint re-sanding, or cleaning and sealing. Start with a free on-site assessment of the pavers, joints and any existing coating.',
  heroImg: '/images/svc-cleanseal.jpg',
  heroAlt: 'Paver cleaning and sealing at a Palm Beach home',
  heroLabel: 'Clean & seal · Palm Beach',
  intro: [
    'Dirt, organic buildup, stains and missing joint sand call for different treatments. We assess the surface before recommending a cleaning method, joint work or sealer. Faded pavers do not automatically need replacing, but cleaning and sealing cannot correct a failed base, settlement or a drainage problem.',
    'For homes in Palm Beach Gardens and across Palm Beach County, the right scope starts with how the space is used. A driveway carries vehicles; a patio or pool deck needs attention to foot traffic and wet conditions. Tell us about puddles, loose pavers, recurring stains and the last time the surface was sealed.',
    'Our Palm Beach driveway clean-and-seal project shows an existing concrete paver surface that was cleaned, re-sanded and sealed. See the project below for its actual scope and photographs. The result on your property depends on its material, condition and previous treatments.',
