    { k: 'Clean', h: 'Address the buildup', p: 'A cleaning method matched to the pavers and the type of stain. Some marks may remain; a test area helps establish a realistic expectation.' },
    { k: 'Re-sand', h: 'Restore depleted joints', p: 'Replace missing joint sand where needed. Loose or sunken pavers need a separate repair assessment; adding sand alone does not fix the base.' },
    { k: 'Seal', h: 'Choose the right finish', p: 'Sealing can help resist stains and change the appearance, depending on the product. Compatibility with the pavers and any existing coating comes first.' },
