    { title: 'Cleaning only', desc: 'For a surface that needs dirt and buildup removed. Cleaning does not automatically include new joint sand, sealer or repair of damaged pavers. Ask whether a stained test area should be assessed first.' },
    { title: 'Cleaning plus re-sanding', desc: 'For pavers that need cleaning and depleted joints replenished with suitable joint sand. The joint material and preparation depend on the existing installation. Settlement and drainage repairs are separate work.' },
